EN:
Strange,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} I thought I heard someone
inside.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}} I should really stop reading
all those spy novels.{{TAG:0007:0008:96000000}}

FR:
Tiens, j'aurais juré avoir entendu du
bruit à l'intérieur...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}} Il faut croire que
j'ai rêvé...{{TAG:0007:0008:96000000}}

IT:
Strano,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} credevo di aver sentito
un rumore...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}} Tutti quei romanzi gialli
che leggo mi suggestionano troppo.{{TAG:0007:0008:96000000}}

TRANSLATION:
Tuhaf,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} içeriden bir ses duydum
sanmıştım.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}} Şu casus romanlarını
biraz az okumalıyım galiba.{{TAG:0007:0008:96000000}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Estaba haciendo unos recados y,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
como pasaba por aquí, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}me he
parado a saludar.

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ça me fait plaisir de te voir !{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
J'avais peur que tu ne sois pas
chez toi !

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Hach, wie schön, dich zu sehen.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ich
weiß, du hast mich nicht erwartet.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Da habe ich Glück, dass du da bist.

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}C'est drôlement bien rangé chez toi.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Tu devrais voir ma chambre !{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} Pleine
de bouquins et de fossiles, hi hi !

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Bei dir ist es so aufgeräumt!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ganz im Gegensatz zu meinem
Zimmer, hihi.
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Da liegen überall Bücher und
Fossilien und Notizen herum.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}
Manchmal auch Kuchenkrümel.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Biraz sosyalleşmek istedim, ben de
yanında vakit geçirmek için uğradım.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Umarım sakıncası yoktur.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Oh,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} right!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I have a little present for
you that I hope you like. It's {{TAG:000E:0002:}}
{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}.

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Oh, j'allais oublier mon cadeau !{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Tiens, {{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}
rien que pour toi !

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Aa,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} doğru!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Umarım hoşuna gider diye
sana küçük bir hediye getirdim. {{TAG:000E:0002:}}
{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Bon,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ora devo proprio andare.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ti ho già rubato troooppo tempo.
Merci della chiacchierata!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}All right,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} I think I'll be going now.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Thank you for being such a lovely
host.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Pekâlâ,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} sanırım artık gideyim.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Böyle güzel bir ev sahibi olduğun
için teşekkür ederim.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}En fin, creo que me marcho ya.
{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Gracias por tu tiempo, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}bichín,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
te lo agradezco mucho.

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Oh, tu étais sur le point de sortir ?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Excuse-moi, je ne veux pas te
retenir{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}. À bientôt !

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Oh,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} devi uscire?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Spero di non averti
fatto perdere troppo tempo.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ci vediamo in città!
